      "content": "the problem is that \"peace\" sounds more like fading away. i've spent my whole life in this intense, constant creation. the thought of just sitting around, watching my mind and my hands slowly fail me, it feels almost more insulting than if I had never succeeded at all. it's like a masterpiece that's finished, and then you just have to stand there and watch the canvas rot. wouldn't it be more dignified to just... step away before the decline becomes the only thing people see?",
